# Bastion's leaders: the commanding officer at the stronghold and the outpost commanders.
# Voice: clipped, procedural, tired; close with its own. Nobody is coming; they're all they have.

conv bastion.leader.roster
for stronghold:bastion, seat:bastion/outpost_lead
topic "Ask about the board on the wall."
prio world
voice bastion

node start
  say "The roster. Every name, every duty, in grease pencil. A name on it eats, stands a watch, and is looked for if it doesn't come back."
  say "The dead stay on it. We read them at the roll."
  > @rubout "Do you ever rub a name out?" -> rubout
  > @soldier "Procedure says you strike the dead." -> soldier   if bg:soldier,police
  > @on "Could my name go on it?" -> sign
  > @other "Something else." -> hub

node rubout
  say "One kind. A man listed KIA who walks back in. Then we rub out the KIA, not the man."
  say "Hasn't happened often. It's happened."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

node soldier
  say "Procedure says a lot. Procedure was written by people who were coming back for us."
  say "Nobody is coming. So the names stay. We're all we have."
  do learn:bastion.roster
  > @back2 "Understood." -> hub

node sign
  say? tier:bastion>=trusted :: "You're on it already, under civilians attached. Someone wrote it in last week. Nobody asked you."
  say "Civilians get signed on. Families, mechanics. You'd stand a watch and eat what we eat. That's the whole contract."
  > @think "I'll think about it." -> hub
  > @why "What does it get me?" -> what

node what
  say "A name on a board, and somebody who comes looking if you don't answer the roll."
  say "Out here that's most of what anyone has."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv bastion.leader.command
for stronghold:bastion, seat:bastion/outpost_lead
topic "Ask if Command ever answers."
prio flavour
voice bastion

node start
  say "Every night. Effective strength, rounds, fuel, civilians sheltered. Then: requesting relief."
  say "Then the operator writes: no reply. The sergeant chalks up a day."
  > @stop "Why not stop calling?" -> stop
  > @other4 "Something else." -> hub

node stop
  say "Every post hears the others. As long as the calls go out, nobody's the last one left."
  say "First post that stops calling is the first post that's alone. Not us. Not tonight."
  > @back4 "Something else." -> hub
